{
  "reason": "Use Tier 2: replace the ranking objective with pairwise logistic loss. Balanced BCE achieved the best reported macro HR@10 of 0.5387, while sampled softmax, attention, and causal mean memory failed to exceed it; this motivates testing relative ranking without softmax competition rather than adding more representation layers. The proposed loss is distinct from previous attempts and tests whether directly supervising positive-negative margins improves top-10 retrieval; the trajectory does not establish the cause of stagnation.",
  "module": [
    "model_design"
  ],
  "plan": {
    "data_processing_and_feature_engineering": null,
    "model_design": "Change only ConvRec.ranking_loss(self, seq, targets) to a masked pairwise logistic objective, retaining the supplied convolution, attention, causal memory, tied item embeddings, and jointly learned item_bias for a controlled Tier 2 experiment. Preserve features, b, t, h, positive, negatives, positive_scores, negative_scores, allowed, TOKEN_LIMIT=2048, and the existing 256 shared uniform negative draws; compute pairwise_loss = F.softplus(negative_scores.float() - positive_scores.float().unsqueeze(-1)), mask target collisions with torch.where(allowed, pairwise_loss, torch.zeros_like(pairwise_loss)), normalize each position by allowed.sum(-1).clamp_min(1), and average across positions. This directly encourages positive scores to exceed negative scores without requiring absolute BCE calibration or coupling all candidates through logsumexp; positions without allowed negatives contribute zero, and no temperature, auxiliary objective, sampling change, or recency weighting is introduced. Preserve the ConvRec constructor, forward, predict, checkpoint config/state_dict format, predictor writer, sequence preparation, supplied splits, preprocessing seed 0, training seed 42, optimizer, schedule, environment-controlled SASREC_EPOCHS default 200, early stopping, and fixed seed-42 validation HR@10 procedure. Keep DATA_DIR=os.environ['GAGC_DATA_DIR'], trial-local artifacts, all four category routes, single-GPU execution within the shared budget, and exactly one newly trained model and selected checkpoint per category; compare authoritative host macro HR@10 against both the supplied current result of 0.5000 and historical best of 0.5387 without accessing hidden tests or other trials.",
    "training_evaluation": null
  }
}
